     7	  DELETE /api/v1/bindings/{name}   Authorization: Bearer <key> -> 204
     8	  GET    /api/v1/links/{name}/route Authorization: Bearer <key> -> 200 {state, client, since, generation, ...}
     9	  POST   /api/v1/links/{name}/sync  Authorization: Bearer <key> {client, generation, state, copy, epoch} -> 200 {sync}
    10	  POST   /api/v1/links/{name}/visitor-key Authorization: Bearer <key> -> 200 {visitorKey} (R6.2)
    11	  GET    /api/v1/health            -> 200 {ok, frps, relayStarted} while frps takes logins, else 503
    12	frps plugin (local only): POST /frp/handler?op=Login|NewProxy|Ping
    13	Admin (as the service user): relay.py admin list|show|ban|unban|release|banned-caddy ...
